  "summary": "Full assessment of all 177 Japanese/Vietnamese passages and both titles. The ten dreams — the hundred-year wait and the lily, the samurai and the koan, the blind child, the old man and the snake, the woman and Amanojaku, Unkei carving the Niō, the ship, the barbershop mirror, the mother’s hundred prayers and Shōtarō with the pigs — are complete and in order. The first separate-context pass scored the draft at 8.6 with three open major findings (units, bonfire, speech tags), which blocked release; after revision a second fresh pass scored 8.925 with minor findings only, nine of which were applied. Fidelity, voice, imagery and mechanics are 9.0, naturalness 8.5. Unrounded weighted score 8.925 meets the unchanged 8.6 threshold. No unresolved major or critical issue remains.",
  "title_review": {
    "source_title": "夢十夜",
    "target_title": "Mười đêm mộng",
    "rationale": "Mười đêm mộng is concise and literary, keeping the pairing of dream and night in 夢十夜."
  }
